{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00266","headline":"赋得北方有佳人 · 徐贤妃","name":"赋得北方有佳人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来称独立，本自号倾城。\n柳叶眉间发，桃花脸上生。\n腕摇金钏响，步转玉环鸣。\n纤腰宜宝袜，红衫艳织成。\n悬知一顾重，别觉舞腰轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐贤妃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}